summary:
  A paired speaker's Forget button is shown under the pointer and at no
  other time.

history:
  Up to 2026.43 the button's opacity rose on a hover or once its question
  was asked, and it was visible only above zero: Tab could not land on a
  button that was not there, so a speaker could not be unpaired from the
  keyboard. 2026.44 shows it while the speaker's tick or the button itself
  has the focus.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
                                      opacity: (btRowHover.hovered || armed || activeFocus || btRowDelegate.activeFocus) ? 0.75 : 0.0

replace:
                                      opacity: (btRowHover.hovered || armed) ? 0.75 : 0.0

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_a_paired_speaker_and_its_forget_are_reached_with_tab.
  The behaviour itself is tests/qml/tst_btforget.qml::test_forget_is_shown_for_the_speaker_under_the_focus_only,
  on a copy of the row. Line-neutral.
